<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Six weeks to ISF Forum: what has come together</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>50+ speakers, two accelerator finals and 18 awards in Ibadan on 27 and 28 November.</mj-preview>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" />
      <mj-section padding="0px" />
      <mj-column padding="0px" />
      <mj-image padding="0px" />
      <mj-text color="#222222" font-size="16px" line-height="1.65" padding="0 36px 16px 36px" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style>
      a { color: #1E6F64; }
      .lead { color: #1E6F64; }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#F2F4F3" width="600px">

    <!-- Top line -->
    <mj-section padding="22px 0 10px 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text font-size="12px" line-height="1.5" color="#5E6B68" letter-spacing="1px" align="center" padding="0 24px">ISF FORUM 2026 &middot; 27 AND 28 NOVEMBER &middot; ICC IBADAN</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Header photo (still from the trailer, links to the page with the film) -->
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" border-radius="6px 6px 0 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://theisfforum.com/video/isf-trailer-poster.jpg" width="600px" border-radius="6px 6px 0 0" href="https://theisfforum.com/forum" alt="A speaker in conversation with delegates at a previous ISF Forum in Ibadan" />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Letter -->
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="34px 0 6px 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>Hi {{firstName}},</mj-text>
        <mj-text>You are receiving this because you are part of the {{community}} community. ISF Forum 2026 is six weeks away, on 27 and 28 November at the International Conference Centre in Ibadan, so here is what has come together.</mj-text>
        <mj-text><strong class="lead">More than 50 speakers.</strong> Iyin Aboyeji of Future Africa, who co-founded Andela and Flutterwave. Chika Nwosu of PalmPay. Kashifu Inuwa Abdullahi of NITDA. Dr. Vincent Olatunji of the NDPC. Satoshi Shinada of Verod-Kepple Africa Ventures. Claire Lavielle of Chapter54. Governor Seyi Makinde will host us.</mj-text>
        <mj-text><strong class="lead">Friday is builders' day.</strong> Two accelerator finals run side by side, the top three companies join our investor pipeline, and the evening ends with a networking reception.</mj-text>
        <mj-text><strong class="lead">Saturday is the Forum.</strong> Masterclasses in the morning, the keynote at 11:30, four afternoon tracks, then the Gala Dinner, where the 18 Scale Without Borders Awards are presented. Nominations are open, with no entry fee.</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Second photo -->
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 36px 26px 36px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://theisfforum.com/editions/winners.jpg" width="528px" border-radius="4px" href="https://theisfforum.com/forum" alt="Award recipients on stage at ISF Summit 2024" />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 0 8px 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>Passes start at &#8358;5,000 for students and &#8358;15,000 for general admission. Delegate (&#8358;75,000) and VIP (&#8358;150,000) passes close on 1 November.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://tickets.theisfforum.com/#/buyTickets/selectTickets?lang=en" background-color="#1E6F64" color="#FFFFFF" font-size="16px" font-weight="700" border-radius="4px" inner-padding="14px 30px" align="left" padding="4px 36px 22px 36px">Choose your pass</mj-button>
        <mj-text>The full programme, every speaker and the award categories are on <a href="https://theisfforum.com/forum" style="color:#1E6F64;text-decoration:underline;">the ISF Forum website</a>.</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="6px 36px 34px 36px">See you in Ibadan,<br />David Adeleke<br /><span style="color:#5E6B68;">Convener, ISF Forum</span></mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- FIXED BOTTOM: Ibadan banner -->
    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" border-radius="0 0 6px 6px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DaxlinksG/email-templates/isf-newsletter-assets/isf-2026/speakers-oct/isf-big-ideas-banner.jpg" width="600px" border-radius="0 0 6px 6px" href="https://theisfforum.com/forum" alt="ISF Forum 2026 banner showing the Ibadan skyline" />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <mj-section padding="22px 0 30px 0">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text font-size="12px" line-height="1.6" color="#666666" align="center" padding="0 32px 6px 32px">ISF Forum &middot; Ibadan, Oyo State, Nigeria</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="12px" line-height="1.6" color="#666666" align="center" padding="0 32px 6px 32px">You are receiving this email because you are part of the {{community}} community.</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="12px" line-height="1.6" color="#666666" align="center" padding="0 32px"><a href="{{UNSUBSCRIBE_URL}}" style="color:#666666;text-decoration:underline;">Unsubscribe</a></mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

  </mj-body>
</mjml>
